      "description": " CT1: §2.1.2亚洲含东南亚；§2.2.4/5.2事件与星号；§6.1.1直接事件投放；§8.1.3核战即时终局；§9中国持有/正常转交/事件例外/使用限制；§10.3 VP。 WG1: Sections 5.2, 10.2, 10.3.1: successful event disposition, signed VP and complete-event automatic victory. Section 10.3.2 zero draw literally follows final scoring; not a dedicated Wargames ruling."
    },
    {
      "id": "F2010",
      "url": "https://www.gmtgames.com/nnts/FAQv5.pdf",
      "scope": "采用未被新版覆盖的太空弃牌与双方扣留一般裁定；排除CF-001旧答案，CF-003按用户确认的新版优先解释",
      "description": " CT1: PDF p4 #6实际US中国太空取消Formosan及不可事件弃置；p8 #35不弃手中未发生的Formosan；p19中国不计普通手牌。未发现三牌专门答案。 WG1: PDF p17-18 #100: no final scoring; only used at DEFCON 2; three choices give six and end, give six and continue, or neither. No dedicated zero-result answer in this block."
    },
    {
      "id": "PROJECT-HC1",
      "url": null,
      "edition": "Engineering and card-text derivations, 2026-10-06",
      "description": "按稳定CardId排序后权威均匀抽样，空普通手牌完成无变化不抽随机，单候选抽一次逻辑随机；原子牌区/随机收据/子帧、私有候选和回放投影为工程约定。空手牌为无可弃对象推导，非专门FAQ。"
    },
    {
      "id": "PROJECT-SE1",
      "url": null,
      "edition": "Engineering projection / card-text derivation, 2026-10-06",
      "description": "不可变计分事实、Holding实体暂存、一次提交净VP/消费收据为工程设计。目标仍不从Control分母删除（FAQ Control必须被阻止）；无USSR战场时零扣分仍在下一匹配实际计分消费是next scoring文本推导，非专门FAQ。预览只算不消费。"
    },
    {
      "id": "PROJECT-DV1",
      "url": null,
      "edition": "Engineering contracts, 2026-10-06",
      "description": "按卡文步骤每次DEFCON或本事件完整VP批次即时判胜，吸收态停止余步；合法选择前不改轨道，不凭印刷OPS计算VP/军事。军事沿既有非负累计总量存储，不凭图形轨道 invent cap。"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-DELUXE-EN",
      "url": "https://www.gmtgames.com/nnts/TS_Cards_Deluxe.pdf",
      "edition": "English Deluxe card images",
      "description": "亲看英文PDF p2 #5、p9 #58、p11 #71、p12 #76；FYP为US关联及持有者条件、转交面向与奖励；不使用旁列译文。 WG1: Visually inspected PDF p15 English #100: Neutral, 4 Ops, Late, starred; DEFCON 2; give opponent 6 VP then may end without Final Scoring."
    },
    {
      "id": "PROJECT-CT1",
      "url": null,
      "edition": "Holder branch and typed transaction contracts, 2026-10-12",
      "description": "自己持FaceDown走奖励且不翻面为卡文直接推导；独立来源/China状态、原子计划/收据、延迟源牌去向和终局草稿为工程设计；离线模型不是真实鉴权或存档。"
    },
    {
      "id": "PROJECT-WG1",
      "url": null,
      "edition": "Named derivations and engineering boundary, 2026-10-12",
      "description": "WG1-DERIVED-01: DEFCON 2 DeclineBoth counts as used and removes by FAQ used condition plus section 5.2, not a dedicated disposal answer. Nonzero Wargames winner follows accepted signed-VP comparison. Zero GiveSixAndEnd remains RequiresRuling pending explicit project policy. Source/receipt/atomic cleanup are planned contracts."
    }
